== Effects ==
* Spawns a glass [[familiar]] that follows Isaac.
** {{dlc|nr+}} The milk spills on the floor upon taking damage. After which, Isaac gains -2 [[Attributes#Tear Delay|tear delay]] ({{dlc|r}} +1.0 [[fire rate]]) until leaving the [[Rooms|room]]. The familiar will reappear in the next room.
** {{dlc|r+}} The milk will block projectiles and take damage up to 10 times, after which the familiar shatters granting Isaac +1.0 [[fire rate]] for the rest of the floor. The familiar will reappear upon entering a new floor.
*** The familiar can also take damage from contact with enemies, enemy lasers and all explosions, although they are not blocked or pushed back.
** Direct tear delay reduction can break the normal soft fire rate cap.

== Notes ==
* The milk puddle is purely visual, and will stay on the ground for a few seconds before disappearing.
* {{dlc|rnr+}} [[Familiar]]s that follow behind Isaac have a certain priority in how close their position is to him over other familiars, with Milk! having the lowest priority at 6th and thus being farther from Isaac than familiars of different priorities.
** {{dlc+|r+}} Milk! has the third-highest priority; just behind {{i|Incubus}}.{{dlc-}}


== Synergies ==
* {{dlc|nr}} {{i|Box of Friends}}: The milk familiar is not duplicated; instead, tear delay decreases by 2 upon use even if the player has not taken damage in the current room.
** {{dlc|r}} No extra tear delay is granted, neither before nor after breaking.
* {{i|Rock Bottom}}: If activated at least once, the increased rate of fire will always be active.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|BFFS!}}: Familiar is bigger but no effect on tear delay.

