== Bugs ==
{{bug|dlc=nr|When the milk is spilled and becomes a puddle while {{t|Extension Cord|n}} is equipped, the electricity will fire consistently to the upper left even when the puddle disappears.}}
{{bug| dlc=r+ |The milk familiar has a chance to block a projectile, but not count towards breaking. This is indicated by the familiar not flashing red despite blocking a shot.}}
{{bug| dlc=r+ |If the run is exited and resumed when the familiar has been broken, it will reppear but only hover at the latest entrance to the current room. It can still block enemy shots and flashes red when damaged, but can't be broken again. It becomes normal again upon entering the next stage.}}

